pændende dynamik mellem de to hovedpersoner.', 'There is an exciting dynamic between the two main characters.'), ('talentfuld', 'word', 'ac0bacf8-280e-55b2-82cf-34abc2d6507a', 1, 'adjective', null, 'talented', 'Hun er en talentfuld musiker.', 'She is a talented musician.'), ('forbryder', 'word', '406261bc-d156-569a-be11-3f73366eef5f', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'criminal', 'Politiet anholdt forbryderen samme aften.', 'The police arrested the criminal the same evening.'), ('gennemskue', 'word', '1c498935-a351-5ad7-91c1-342001df6ecb', 1, 'verb', null, 'to see through, to figure out', 'Hun gennemskuede hans løgn med det samme.', 'She saw through his lie right away.'), ('taknemlig', 'word', '16077627-680a-5f00-9184-4c3b12038e90', 1, 'adjective', null, 'grateful', 'Jeg er meget taknemlig for din hjælp.', 'I am very grateful for your help.'), ('handicap', 'word', 'e302beb8-b995-5235-9eb1-aff3a292d2e5', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'disability', 'Han lever med et fysisk handicap.', 'He lives with a physical disability.'), ('mægtig', 'word', 'c7ba4dde-c1ce-52e9-91b9-fbf9bf11f00d', 1, 'adjective', null, 'mighty, powerful', 'Kongen var en mægtig hersker.', 'The king was a mighty ruler.'), ('politimand', 'word', '80cac1c1-0d5f-5cc3-96a0-0201280ec786', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'policeman', 'En politimand hjalp os med vej.', 'A policeman helped us with directions.'), ('stakkels', 'word', 'df08ec2a-cca7-5db4-b838-6ba4abb8349d', 1, 'adjective', null, 'poor, wretched (someone to be pitied)', 'Den stakkels hund var helt alene.', 'The poor dog was all alone.'), ('diesel', 'word', 'a02bf936-98e0-5e82-a9da-7724315f8f38', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'diesel (fuel)', 'Bilen kører på diesel.', 'The car runs on diesel.'), ('objektiv', 'word', 'f873255e-cfa8-5a7e-a106-ecba1423cbdf', 1, 'adjective', null, 'objective', 'Journalisten forsøgte at være objektiv.', 'The journalist tried to be objective.'), ('vismand', 'word', 'f990161d-b1bf-50de-ac8b-8f68c0ae5ab4', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'sage, economic expert (government adviser)', 'Vismand advarede om en kommende krise.', 'The economic expert warned of an upcoming crisis.'), ('autentisk', 'word', 'd19e2cc6-0990-5832-a903-6a5d1d77bae5', 1, 'adjective', null, 'authentic', 'Restauranten serverer autentisk italiensk mad.', 'The restaurant serves authentic Italian food.'), ('barriere', 'word', '2d575a34-0dd2-5b1f-a2ff-585ee323046e', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'barrier, obstacle', 'Sproget var den største barriere for dem.', 'Language was the biggest barrier for them.'), ('booke', 'word', '40c0f92b-6c97-5652-b137-e6c19c8860cb', 1, 'verb', null, 'to book', 'Vi bookede et bord til klokken syv.', 'We booked a table for seven o''clock.'), ('dumpe', 'word', '5429290b-fb9b-56dc-844e-888fddb76847', 1, 'verb', null, 'to fail (an exam)', 'Han dumpede til køreprøven.', 'He failed his driving test.'), ('seddel', 'word', '7cad16e1-8c2b-5bee-9f6a-1bc4405bbe0d', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'banknote', 'Han betalte med en gammel seddel.', 'He paid with an old banknote.'), ('seddel', 'word', '989a4509-500f-5deb-a319-f65a4159c2d4', 2, 'noun', 'en', 'note, slip of paper', 'Hun skrev en seddel til sin mand.', 'She wrote a note to her husband.'), ('lektie', 'word', '56e7c3e0-4d62-53e1-8b24-006a25d546e0', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'homework', 'Børnene laver deres lektier efter skole.', 'The children do their homework after school.'), ('kapitalfond', 'word', 'c760df0f-66b2-5e6c-b6a5-45caa69b704e', 1, 'noun', null, 'private equity fund', 'En stor kapitalfond opkøbte virksomheden.', 'A large private equity fund bought up the company.'), ('vedligeholde', 'word', '7bf82c7c-6ec8-5fd0-95e9-ee783dec9057', 1, 'verb', null, 'to maintain, to service', 'Det er vigtigt at vedligeholde huset løbende.', 'It is important to maintain the house regularly.'), ('mekanisme', 'word', '5a3a018c-f59c-57d6-a499-32d2ed75d115', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'mechanism', 'Uret har en kompliceret mekanisme.', 'The clock has a complicated mechanism.'), ('hvidløg', 'word', '8b0ffc89-2cb5-558c-84b9-9dcd4fc24c64', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'garlic', 'Kom to fed