dreløse børn.', 'He acted as guardian for the orphaned children.'), ('slogan', 'word', '74d77397-7d90-5a93-9cde-70aa21a41136', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'slogan', 'Firmaets nye slogan er nemt at huske.', 'The company''s new slogan is easy to remember.'), ('drue', 'word', 'f894b8ba-173c-5cf4-9fd7-3e87422e9451', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'grape', 'Hun spiste en klase druer til dessert.', 'She ate a bunch of grapes for dessert.'), ('holdbar', 'word', '73d0beb6-41d5-5ce6-8c31-3d8f86eba761', 1, 'adjective', null, 'durable, lasting', 'Vi har brug for en holdbar løsning på problemet.', 'We need a lasting solution to the problem.'), ('komposition', 'word', '0e931ff3-e07f-5229-af9b-a946163df123', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'composition (musical, artistic)', 'Han skrev en ny komposition til orkestret.', 'He wrote a new composition for the orchestra.'), ('punktum', 'word', '5ec507ea-70c8-518b-8682-1366ac5be92f', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'full stop, period', 'Husk at sætte punktum efter sætningen.', 'Remember to put a full stop after the sentence.'), ('skær', 'word', '4f017685-0b2f-51fd-8357-34247261475a', 1, 'noun', null, 'glow, tinge (of light)', 'Solen kastede et rødt skær over himlen.', 'The sun cast a red glow over the sky.'), ('væld', 'word', '4cb7ae01-bcd0-5a48-8c2d-b40845411696', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'abundance, wealth', 'Der er et væld af muligheder for de studerende.', 'There is a wealth of opportunities for the students.'), ('brandvæsen', 'word', 'fa5ec1ba-804b-588e-b75e-018c57e4967f', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'fire service', 'Brandvæsen slukkede branden på under en time.', 'The fire service put out the fire in under an hour.'), ('diabetes', 'word', '060f4896-80c7-5b76-9a92-e5ee0c7baa23', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'diabetes', 'Han blev diagnosticeret med diabetes som barn.', 'He was diagnosed with diabetes as a child.'), ('hed', 'word', '4e832715-dcbd-5a21-93ed-ed3108bb5320', 1, 'adjective', null, 'hot', 'Kaffen er stadig hed.', 'The coffee is still hot.'), ('lodret', 'word', 'a3f3ac4b-a1b6-5e0c-8b53-981935a0e240', 1, 'adjective', null, 'vertical', 'Stregen skal være lodret.', 'The line must be vertical.'), ('vinke', 'word', '33f4ab59-ce99-5fc9-8d40-b50e8e43a42d', 1, 'verb', null, 'to wave', 'Hun plejer at vinke til naboen.', 'She usually waves to the neighbour.'), ('lejer', 'word', '5e2aa8e0-dea7-50ad-af03-e44a6fa68c95', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'tenant', 'Lejeren betaler husleje hver måned.', 'The tenant pays rent every month.'), ('publicere', 'word', 'a5dce5cf-a35c-54a0-807c-61178f702722', 1, 'verb', null, 'to publish', 'Forfatteren vil publicere en ny bog.', 'The author wants to publish a new book.'), ('legat', 'word', 'aef62b7a-95c8-5bab-92d1-5d8298695907', 1, 'noun', null, 'scholarship, grant', 'Hun fik et legat til sine studier.', 'She got a scholarship for her studies.'), ('usandsynlig', 'word', '3619d30d-c104-5445-ba84-fc071ade99cb', 1, 'adjective', null, 'unlikely, improbable', 'Det er usandsynligt, at han kommer i dag.', 'It is unlikely that he will come today.'), ('årsmøde', 'word', '960127a3-c1ab-5d27-8c91-58bdc89a7a9d', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'annual meeting', 'Foreningen holder årsmøde i marts.', 'The association holds its annual meeting in March.')),
known as (
  select incoming.* from incoming
  where exists (
    select 1 from public.word_catalog_sense existing
    where existing.lemma = incoming.lemma and existing.kind = incoming.kind
      and existing.sense_id = incoming.sense_id::uuid and existing.lang <> 'en'
  )
),
written as (
  insert into public.word_catalog_sense (lemma, kind, sense_id, ordinal, lang, text, pos, gender, example, example_translation, generator)
  select lemma, kind, sense_id::uuid, ordinal, 'en', text, pos, gender, example, example_translation, 'locale-en-2026-09-25' from known
  on conflict (lemma, kind, sense_id, lang) do update set
    text = excluded.text, example = excluded.example, example_translation = excluded.example_translation, generator = excluded.generator
  returning 1
)
select (select count(*) from incoming) as incoming, (select count(*) from known) as matched, (select count(*) from written) as written;
